   TUI-ARCHITECTURE.md for sources, tradeoffs and migration acceptance checks.

   [x] Architecture implementation
   Migrated to Tears 0.8.0 and Ratatui 0.30.2. Model/update/view/effects are
   separated. Blocking workers report progress and completion; duplicate jobs
   and stale results are rejected. Quit waits for active work. Linux tests and
   PTY copy/error/resize/restoration checks pass. macOS execution remains pending
   in CI; no Mac runtime verification is claimed.

6. [x] Sync books from Kobo
   For every non-preview book available on the Kobo but absent from the reader,
   import, optimize and transfer it. Start with a dry run, reliable book identity,
   verified skipping and recovery from interrupted transfers. Share the inventory
   logic with the TUI.
   Implemented `kobo sync`: dry run by default, `--apply` to Wi-Fi or a mounted
   card. Compares full contents, including repacked and optimized copies;
   preserves conflicts and reuses verified local imports on retry. Wi-Fi
   `--repair` preserves matching incomplete uploads before replacement.

