11. [x] Books First
    The app now does not work very logically if the Kobo is not connected, or the
    xteink is not. Instead, we should look at all the books that are found in either
    kobo, xteink _or local_, and show which ones are where. Then when entering, it
    can be decided to sync from any to any (although we should take into account
    that the books that are on the xteink went through an optimisation, so if the
    book is on xteink _and_ on kobo or local, we should take the non-xteink instance
    as the one to sync from either local to kobo or from kobo to local).

    Implemented unified discovery, content-based grouping and explicit Local /
    Kobo / Xteink copy actions. Original copies are preferred, unavailable devices
    do not block other locations, and Kobo receives ordinary sideloaded EPUBs.

